{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763", "id": 1226387966, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5JGTH-", "number": 1763, "title": "Undefined reference to a specific function (offboard.h)", "user": {"login": "BaptisteG42", "id": 104975302, "node_id": "U_kgDOBkHLxg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104975302?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42", "html_url": "https://github.com/BaptisteG42", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2022-05-05T08:50:16Z", "updated_at": "2022-05-05T13:02:20Z", "closed_at": "2022-05-05T13:02:20Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi everyone,\r\n\r\nI'm working on a project in which I need to send MAVLink commands to a PixHawk4, in order to pilot a drone.\r\nFor now, I'm only running examples which are provided by the MAVSDK library, and I'm simulating the PixHawk and the drone with Gazebo.\r\nThe \"takeoff\" example went fine, I just had to add the \"target_link_libraries\" for the telemetry and action modules in the CMakeList, and then everything worked correctly.\r\n\r\nBut then, I tried to merge both \"takeoff\" example with some \"offboard\" example functions.\r\nI added the includes in the \"takeoff.cpp\" and updated the \"CMakeList\" with the library needed. And here comes the weird behavior.\r\nMost of the functions and types are well included, except one : \"Offboard::set_position_global()\".\r\nWhen I try to build, the following message comes out : \r\n\r\n /usr/bin/ld\u00a0: CMakeFiles/takeoff_and_land.dir/takeoff_and_land.cpp.o\u00a0: in function \u00ab\u00a0offb_ctrl_pos_global(mavsdk::Offboard&, mavsdk::Telemetry&)\u00a0\u00bb\u00a0:\r\ntakeoff_and_land.cpp:(.text+0x504)\u00a0: undefined reference to \u00ab\u00a0mavsdk::Offboard::set_position_global(mavsdk::Offboard::PositionGlobalYaw) const\u00a0\u00bb\r\n\r\nThe weirdest part is that this function is actually initialized in \"offboard.h\", and it's the only one that provide this error.\r\nI can use every other function without any trouble.\r\n\r\nDoes anyone have or had the same issue ?\r\n\r\nThanks in advance !\r\n\r\nPS : I apologized if my english is bad, as it's not my first language. \r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "BaptisteG42", "id": 104975302, "node_id": "U_kgDOBkHLxg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104975302?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42", "html_url": "https://github.com/BaptisteG42", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1118462698", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763#issuecomment-1118462698", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1763", "id": 1118462698, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5CqmLq", "user": {"login": "BaptisteG42", "id": 104975302, "node_id": "U_kgDOBkHLxg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104975302?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42", "html_url": "https://github.com/BaptisteG42", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BaptisteG42/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/us